            "caption": "What’s your take on social deduction games? Honestly, I usually can’t stand them because there’s never any real logic involved—it’s just people accusing each other based on vibes. But Feed the Kraken is the only one I actually recommend. Even though I’m not a fan of the genre, I love how this one forces you to use actual reasoning instead of just guessing who looks guilty. Plus, don't worry about the recommended player counts—I’ve played it at four and at ten, and it’s a blast regardless, though nine players creates such an awkward, fun challenge that you really have to think through your moves. This is the only social deduction game that feels worth my time. #boardgames #feedthekraken #tabletopgames #socialdeduction #boardgamegeek",
